  <wpt lat="45.777641" lon="-84.780893">
    <name>Headlands Dark Sky Park, Mackinaw City, MI</name>
    <desc>verified 2026-09-26; legacy marker was ~4.2km east near Mackinaw City rather than the park entrance on Headlands Rd</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="46.561438" lon="-86.321306">
    <name>Pictured Rocks National Lakeshore, Munising, MI</name>
    <desc>drive point fixed 2026-09-26: Little Beaver Lake Campground (NPS drive-in campground, osm:way/232089680), the nearest public drive-in site (2.8 km) to Google's 2015 pin for this query, which sits mid-park 28 km east of Munising; Beaver Basin Overlook is 2.0 km from the pin but its access road is a disconnected island in the current US graph (route snap 3.3 km)</desc>
  </wpt>
